1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,680
One defender just left a shooter wide open.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,630
Can you spot him?

3
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,910
He beats his man and the help is coming.

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:06,590
Freeze.

5
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:08,190
A, B, or C?

6
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,770
Two seconds. Make your call.

7
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,190
A looks easy.

8
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:14,910
But his man is still home.

9
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,270
B? His defender is sitting in the lane.

10
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,760
Now watch the low defender.

11
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,810
He left the corner to stop the drive.

12
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,290
There! That's your window.

13
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:22,850
C!

14
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:23,420
Kick it.

15
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:25,550
The next rotation is a step too late.

16
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:27,600
The ball tells you where the play is.

17
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:29,750
The defense tells you where to pass.

18
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,370
Did you see it before the reveal?

19
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,230
Run it back.

